  "lore": "Mr. Fantastic, also known as Reed Richards, is the leader of the Fantastic Four from Marvel Comics. After gaining elastic powers from cosmic radiation, he became one of the smartest minds in the Marvel universe, using his intelligence and stretching abilities to protect the world."
